WEBVTT

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:05.110
That's the last of them.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.690
Hey, thanks for...

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:13.110
My eyes, what's that for?

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.780
Master, why...?

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:22.500
Guri-pon, could you repeat to him
what I'm going to say?

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:40.520
Am I destined to lose my way?

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.690
All I want is to have fun in my life

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:49.230
All I want is to be with those I love

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:55.370
Ready or not
Here I come

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:59.040
I don't care anymore

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.830
I just don't know anymore

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.370
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:08.500
There are days when I think like that

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.420
But everything is precious to me

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:14.260
And so I fight on

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:17.760
Today was a tough day

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:20.850
I almost gave up hope

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:26.940
But the truth is I don't want
to lose anything anymore

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:30.570
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:33.820
There are days when I think like that

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:36.610
But everything is precious to me

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.620
And so I must fight

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.180
#35 Embrace

00:01:56.340 --> 00:02:00.560
What did you do that for, dammit?
Are you the enemy?

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:03.350
I'm a shirogane, just like you.

00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:08.310
I'm a shirogane, just like you.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:11.690
I flashed the automaton's camera at you.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.900
I flashed the automaton's camera at you.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:18.530
Your retinas are burnt,
and will take a while to recover.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.790
-What are they saying?
-Can you pick it up?

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:30.170
People call me the "chimney sweep."
Guy asked me to come here.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.670
I have a score to settle with Faceless.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:38.180
I'll go fight him
and make him tell me how to stop ZONAPHA.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:41.600
So you stay here on Earth.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.020
So you stay here on Earth.

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:45.770
What did you say?

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:47.890
Master, no...

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.190
Guri-pon, keep going.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:52.150
I've fought...

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:56.940
I've fought for a long time.
I'm experienced.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:00.530
I'm well equipped and stronger than you.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:04.580
Do you realize what you're saying?
You won't be coming back.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.120
Yeah, you seem to believe so.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:11.330
But I know of a way I can come back.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.800
So you wait here and don't worry.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.420
Yeah right!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:20.550
I've seen so much misery.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:25.180
Many people died to give me a chance
to achieve what they couldn't.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:30.100
I can't forget them
and just live on by myself.

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:31.480
You fool!

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.570
The past is the past.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.940
You can't do anything about it.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.570
But you can do something about today.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:45.200
I know you have somebody
you can make happy.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.920
Somebody I can make happy?

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:59.380
If we followed your logic,
no human could ever be happy.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:04.600
Everyone would have to live on
bearing the weight of the past.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:08.600
The world would be full of people
not allowed to be happy.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:15.190
What's important is now, this very moment.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.190
Think from your heart, right now.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.660
And make her happy.

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.290
For your own happiness.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:29.700
Go, Kato.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.540
I'll go up instead.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:35.080
Hey, I'm not done with you.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:37.380
Get back here, chimney sweep!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.880
Who the hell are you?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:45.800
A little boy, going up in space?
Impossible.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.140
He would never make it.

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:50.140
Narumi could've, but...

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.520
-Bring that boy here.
-Yes, sir.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.190
Let him go!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.150
You saw him.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:05.820
Masaru defeated all those automata.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:10.490
Besides, he would never say
anything foolish.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:14.750
He must have a winning plan,
a reason for him to go.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:19.380
I believe in Masaru.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:22.920
That's it.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:27.430
He once had Faceless's memory
downloaded into him.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:32.390
He might be the right one
to ask Faceless how to stop ZONAPHA.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:33.640
But...

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:35.640
Either way,

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:40.360
he's our only hope now.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.700
Resume preparing for lift-off.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.160
Yes, sir.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.830
Are you alive?

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.630
Lady Francine is...

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.590
I know.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:12.060
We exist for Lady Francine and her only,
until the very end of our existence.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.900
That's really huge on you.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:28.280
Yeah, this was the smallest one they had.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:30.660
Masaru!

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:32.830
Lise.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:37.540
Liar!

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:42.250
Guy asked you to come here?
You know a way back?

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.300
Those are all lies!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:49.890
I know, you're going instead
to save Mr. Kato.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:57.390
I begged Mr. Fou to let you go.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:04.280
Because I wanted you
to be able to do what you wished.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:08.200
But... but...

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:12.120
I'm a liar, too.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.120
Don't go.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:20.210
Thanks.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.960
But I must go.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.670
I must.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:31.970
I wanted to know more about you.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.930
There were so many things I wanted to do.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:41.810
I wanted to go to the zoo with you,
and make you a box lunch.

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:47.900
Okay.

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:53.530
Let's go to the zoo next week.
Will you make me some rice balls?

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.410
I want to talk with you
about so many things, too.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:02.170
When I get back,
let's be even closer friends.

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.300
Liar.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:14.300
But, it's a promise.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.320
Commence pre-launch checks.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:38.120
Today's my wedding day.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:44.080
I've dressed the prettiest girl in town
in a wedding dress.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:50.510
The priest has come,
but the bride has run away.

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.550
That's okay, my little bird.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:55.430
We have all the time in the world.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:58.100
After you've flitted around enough,

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:05.650
come flying back into my arms.

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:17.160
While I was unconscious, he dressed me up
in this constraining attire.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.830
How could I have let him do that?

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.290
That's not all. My body feels heavy.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:28.000
I'm lacking in blood.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:33.130
But I don't regret it.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:38.760
Now, I must defeat Harlequin,
even if I have to go down with him.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:49.480
I wonder if Kato made it
safely up to space.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.150
Take care.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:57.490
And make Faceless tell you
how to stop ZONAPHA.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:03.870
It's almost time for me to say goodbye
to this earth on which you no longer are.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.960
Right, where has she gone?

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:25.600
Human blood would be the perfect way
to toast my wedding.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:37.490
A human that hasn't contracted ZONAPHA.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.120
Stand back, you puppet...

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.410
Nap time for you.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.160
Now, bottoms up.

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:54.670
I won't let you, you puppet.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.760
Not as long as I breathe.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:00.760
She's...

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:06.680
An angel...

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:11.230
You came flying back after all!

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.940
But that little baby is mine.

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:19.030
I'm going to drink it's blood
to celebrate our marriage.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.370
Never.

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:30.370
Neither I nor the baby is yours.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.750
I will fight till the end.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:38.760
Dear, dear.
I see I must discipline my wife.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:44.600
It's no use. The angel is wounded.

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.390
She can't move anymore.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:51.150
Lord, help us...

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:52.900
Lord...

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:00.360
What now?

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:10.710
Another demon...

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:12.920
Kato!

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:16.880
Wow. How did you find us here?

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:21.680
You'd never understand.
That woman called for me.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:24.050
And I wished for that woman.

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:26.760
That is all.

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:34.190
Really?
But you can hardly see me, can you?

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:38.320
So I swear on
the poop of a poisonous snake,

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:40.440
I'll burn you to a crisp!

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.490
Éléonore, tell me where he is.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:44.110
2 steps to the left, 9 forward!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:46.330
Too slow.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.120
What?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.760
That antique must've targeted my horn.

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:07.430
Well now, I swear on
the dentures of an old man...

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:18.360
10 seconds until lift-off.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.610
9, 8, 7.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.860
Igniting the main engine.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:27.870
4, 3, 2, 1.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.030
Lift-off.

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:42.710
Yes!

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.630
Masaru...

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:49.510
Shirogane!

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:52.640
Where are you, Shirogane!

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.900
Shirogane!

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:00.650
Narumi, I am here!

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:08.320
Shirogane.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.700
Narumi...?

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:17.670
Another strong man went to space instead.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:24.050
I came here for you.

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:29.800
Ever since I first saw you
in that circus tent.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:32.100
Shirogane.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.640
I love you.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:40.360
Narumi...

00:14:58.670 --> 00:15:00.630
There's a light going up.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:04.340
It's got to be the space shuttle.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:08.260
Go, go!

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:12.010
Go, chimney sweep.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.930
That's what he called himself.

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.980
An incredible guy.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.940
What a perfect target.

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:29.240
Pinball-K's cannon never misses.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:41.250
I knew something like this was brewing.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:44.380
Stay out of it, human.

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.050
I'm a pro, you see.

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:49.510
Fool!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:54.760
He made it.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:57.310
Yes.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:03.690
My sight is slowly beginning to return.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:08.780
But when I look at you...

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.900
I'm still dazzled.

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:14.200
It might take a while.

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:17.910
Gosh.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.790
How wonderful this is.

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:26.210
To have your soul reach another.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:34.340
To see the smile of the one you love
close enough to hear him breathe.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:42.190
The two Francines within me are nodding.

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:47.570
Yes, it was like that for me, too.

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:50.820
Yes, as with me.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:55.950
T-Tears?

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.700
What's wrong? You're crying?

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:03.000
I don't know... But I can't stop.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.040
Hey.

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:14.720
I love this man, I really do.

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:20.720
I love him.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:24.770
I love him so much.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:39.740
Can this be real?

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:43.410
I cannot believe what I am seeing.

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:47.830
This is it.

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.800
The mission for us automata.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.630
What we'd yearned after for so long.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:59.720
Look, Pantalone.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.390
Lady Francine...

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:07.230
She is smiling.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:16.780
How beautiful Lady Francine is.

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:21.240
Is she not, Pantalone?

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.250
Do you see her?

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.500
Oh.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:33.590
You do.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:39.220
You see her.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:53.400
Seems like he's off and away safely.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:57.070
You took me too lightly.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:02.450
Didn't think my gun
had Fou's special bullets in it, eh?

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:05.250
Took you by surprise.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:12.630
You should never take
a professional assassin lightly.

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:23.140
But I guess a real pro
wouldn't take on a job for 10 yen.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:27.140
I've been hired by the little boy
for a hefty sum.

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:29.060
Then I'll hire you too.

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:31.900
For 10 yen.

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:35.070
Leave it to me.

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.240
Why...

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:42.620
Why did I say such a thing?

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:46.450
I want to hire you.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:51.330
Switch to my side.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:55.380
So.

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:02.760
How much...

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:07.350
are you gonna pay me?

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.250
Is that a well?

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:34.750
There's oxygen in here.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:55.270
Francine.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.360
I'm Francine.

00:20:57.650 --> 00:21:02.570
-I'm Francine.
-I'm Francine.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:08.870
Hear that? Her voice is lovely, isn't it.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:15.420
Even though
you took Éléonore away from me.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:19.550
We meet again, Masaru.

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.800
Are you Faceless?

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:26.720
It's nice having a real natural body.

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:31.470
I changed into a body I'd cloned
from my old human body's cells.

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:34.810
My previous body was too banged up.

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.320
So I live here now,
surrounded by the Francines.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:42.190
And I watch the humans on Earth
as they die off.

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:45.360
I plan to just age and die after that.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:47.950
Is that what you wish for?

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:51.450
I'm fickle and get bored easily.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:56.960
Now that I can't have Éléonore,
I've gotten tired of myself.

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:01.050
Then haven't you had enough?

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.470
Save the people of the world.

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:09.180
Please! Tell me how to cure ZONAPHA!

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:25.070
A past that can't become a memory
plays on repeat

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:29.990
In my mind is a forgotten thing
that I still remember

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:34.660
Questions remain unanswered
but I must go now

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:39.540
I walk in the dark,
making a promise to my footprints

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:44.210
So many similar beings
leading similar lives

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:48.930
Was there a reason
for me to be born at all?

00:22:49.090 --> 00:22:53.680
The world lost all sound
but for the ticking of a clock

00:22:53.850 --> 00:22:58.520
A missing heart keeps shouting

00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:03.320
A meaningless life was shaking

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:08.030
All because of your unique existence

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:12.660
If the reason for the pain
is revealed someday

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:17.410
If you find a home
for those tears someday

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:22.500
You shall sleep
with the whole universe in your arms

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:30.390
I know it still plays in your heart

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:34.390
The melody that brought you here
